Licensing notes for this project:

* The code in this repository (bare-metal port files in `port/`, the native
  RV32I emulator in `emulator/`, and the Python tooling in `model/`) is MIT
  licensed as above.
* `doomgeneric/` is NOT distributed here. `setup_env.sh` clones
  https://github.com/ozkl/doomgeneric (which vendors Chocolate Doom sources,
  GPLv2). The compiled DOOM binary produced from it (`doom_rv32i.bin`) is a
  derivative work and is therefore subject to the GNU GPL v2.
* `doom1.wad` (the DOOM shareware WAD) is downloaded by `setup_env.sh`, not
  redistributed here; it is copyright id Software.
